- How would you handle async validators?
- How would you test the registry and pipeline separately?
- How would you version validators and roll back if a validator changes semantics?

## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates ability to design runtime-extensible components and understand trade-offs when swapping strategies without downtime.

## Key Concepts

- Registry pattern
- Strategy/Policy pattern
- Concurrency control
